@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title (2안) ML 판단 뒤에 이유를 별도로 추정

skinparam defaultFontName "AppleGothic"
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 24
skinparam ranksep 28
top to bottom direction

database "합성·공개 데이터\n개인별 기준값 부족" as DATA #CFD8DC
component "ML 학습" as TRAIN #FFCCBC
component "ML 판정·예측\n판단 근거를 직접\n확인하기 어려움" as MODEL #90A4AE
component "판정 결과" as RESULT #BBDEFB
component "사후 설명\n입력과 결과로\n이유를 다시 추정" as POST #C8E6C9
actor "사용자" as USER

DATA -right-> TRAIN
TRAIN -right-> MODEL
MODEL -down-> RESULT
MODEL -right-> POST : 입력과 결과
RESULT -right-> USER
POST -down-> USER : 추정한 설명
@enduml
